{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Chaotic Flag Battles with Loyal Slimes </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your team of slimes and compete to capture more flags than your opponent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With just a single command, your slimes will run, gather, fight\u2014and sometimes get squished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don\u2019t worry\u2014they\u2019ll bounce right back and get back to work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy quick, high-energy battles with friends or family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play locally in split-screen or online with matchmaking\u2014perfect for some lighthearted competition!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/extras/JPShortEp1.gif?t=1750816392\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Easy to play, hard to master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The controls are easy to learn, but victory comes down to clever strategy and quick thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Send your slimes to capture, defend, or block\u2014reading your opponent and making the right call is key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No complex mechanics, just pure head-to-head strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t let the cute looks fool you\u2014this is a game where sharp decisions make all the difference.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/extras/JPShortEp2.gif?t=1750816392\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An easy RTS anyone can pick up and play.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-paced action that makes you want to play again and again!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sneaky capture-the-flag gameplay to outwit your opponents.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Adorable toon-style visuals and animations.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Quick matches for instant fun.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Compete against players worldwide or enjoy private matches with friends!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Two-player split-screen battles on a single copy of the game.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenge Mode for endless solo fun.</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3084910?t=1750816392","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3084910?t=1750816392","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/be856933b828b25dc6406e3a57c966cd94b42623/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750816392","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/be856933b828b25dc6406e3a57c966cd94b42623/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750816392","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3336720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Chaotic Flag Battles with Loyal Slimes </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your team of slimes and compete to capture more flags than your opponent!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With just a single command, your slimes will run, gather, fight\u2014and sometimes get squished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don\u2019t worry\u2014they\u2019ll bounce right back and