dless solo fun.</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Nukenin"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3084910/header.jpg?t=1750816392","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9Nukenin, Inc.<br />\r\nPublished by Phoenixx Inc.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.9 Mavericks<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.14 Mojave<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257035706,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257035706/movie480.mp4?t=1739260095","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257035706/movie_max.mp4?t=1739260095"},"name":"2nd PV EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257035706/d1ea5f17fdf6b588e4f728d7c7578f49bba42143/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739260095","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257035706/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739260095","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257035706/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739260095"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257153880,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153880/movie480.mp4?t=1749462538","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257153880/movie_max.mp4?t=1749462538"},"name":"SteamNextFest_newPV2en"